  "control_limits_en": "'Nubia was therefore a Christian country consisting of three kingdoms: Nobadia in the north, Makuria in the centre and Alodia in the [south]' (GHA2_CH12). Alodia lay 'in the heartland of the old Kushite kingdom', capital Soba (ZH_EMB_HIST2020: 位于古库西提克王国中心地带…首都在索巴).",
